WEBVTT

00:01:59.579 --> 00:02:03.121
"We're looking for passionate people
who can bring a fresh perspective

00:02:03.163 --> 00:02:06.871
to challenge our way
of thinking," they say.

00:02:06.913 --> 00:02:11.079
"Our diversity is our strength," they say.

00:02:11.871 --> 00:02:13.913
"Come just as you are,"

00:02:15.079 --> 00:02:16.329
they say.

00:02:17.329 --> 00:02:21.246
Recruiters, managers, executives, CEOs --

00:02:21.288 --> 00:02:24.204
all those responsible
for making decisions.

00:02:24.871 --> 00:02:27.704
They say quite a lot.

00:02:28.788 --> 00:02:31.496
And perhaps for good reason.